{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_011B40","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"我想你也明白，尽可能避免和敌人交战，Snake。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":62,"review_flag":"AUX_EXPANSION_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"我们人数少，又不熟悉地形。真要打起正面战，就算是你也免不了陷入苦战。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":"AUX_SURVIVAL_EXPANSION_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"我知道。避免战斗，是潜入任务的基本原则。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"没错。别让敌人掌握你的位置，只在必要时一击脱离，给敌人以重创……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":"AUX_CROSS_ROW_SPLIT_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"这也是游击战的要点。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"}]}